<title>BAHRAIN: Bahraini Saudi Bank '96 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Bahraini Saudi Bank '96 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		(million Bahraini dinars)</p>
<p> Net profit		 3.1	vs    2.8</p>
<p> Operating income	 5.5	vs    4.9</p>
<p> Operating costs	  1.8	vs    1.6</p>
<p> Net interest income    4.8	vs    4.4</p>
<p> Dividend		   1.8	vs    1.7</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds   27.0	vs   25.7</p>
<p> Assets		   135.0	vs  125.7</p>
<p>Full Name: Bahraini Saudi Bank.</p>
<p>Note - The Bahrain-based bank is owned 50-50 by Bahraini and Saudi investors.</p>
</text>
